      "writtenOn": "2022-01-10T01:20:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I originally made it a \u0027SELECT\u0027, which forces it on, unfortunately this only works for bool configs (sets it to \u0027y\u0027).\nAnd yes, if I make it a \u0027depends on\u0027, it fails with a circular dependency.",
